ttps://blog.2nfree.com/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-2/cicd.webp" title="/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-2/cicd.webp" data-thumbnail="/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-2/cicd.webp" data-sub-html="&lt;h2&gt;/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-2/cicd.webp&lt;/h2&gt;"&gt;&lt;img loading="lazy" src='https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-2/cicd.webp' alt="/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-2/cicd.webp" height="442" width="681"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="准备工作"&gt;&lt;span&gt;准备工作&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%87%86%e5%a4%87%e5%b7%a5%e4%bd%9c" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;在配置流水线之前需要进行一些准备工作&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从零实现CI/CD（一）- Jenkins的安装部署的多种方式</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-1/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Feb 2024 16:20:11 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/cicd-in-kubernetes-based-jenkins-1/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/categories/%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/">云原生</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="前言"&gt;&lt;span&gt;前言&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%89%8d%e8%a8%80" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;| &lt;a href="https://jenkins.io" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Jenkins&lt;/a&gt; 是一个开源的自动化服务器，主要用于自动化构建、测试和部署软件。它是基于Java开发的，可以在多种环境中运行，如 Linux，Windows 及其他类Unix操作系统。&#10;| Jenkins 非常灵活，提供了丰富的插件系统，通过安装和配置这些插件，可以使 Jenkins 支持多种工具和平台，从而适应各种不同的 CI/CD（持续集成/持续部署）需求。&#10;| Jenkins 能够帮助团队实现自动化构建、测试和部署，加速软件交付的速度。尽管 Jenkins 本身不是云原生产品，但通过与现代云技术的集成，它能够有效支持云原生应用的开发和运维工作。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>云原生体系下的CI/CD介绍</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/cicd-in-cloud-native/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Feb 2024 16:20:11 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/cicd-in-cloud-native/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/categories/%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/">云原生</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="cicd介绍"&gt;&lt;span&gt;CI/CD介绍&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#cicd%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="什么是cicd"&gt;&lt;span&gt;什么是CI/CD&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e6%98%afcicd" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;CI/CD 是持续集成/持续交付（Continuous Integration / Continuous Delivery）的缩写，是一种开发流程和技术实践。CI/CD 将软件开发过程中的自动化和快速迭代理念贯穿始终，并通过自动化工具、流程和原则来实现。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>好用的 Kubernetes 命令</title><link>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/useful-kubernetes-commands/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Jul 2023 17:54:39 +0000</pubDate><author>komorebi2333@gmail.com (komorebi)</author><guid>https://blog.2nfree.com/posts/useful-kubernetes-commands/</guid><category domain="https://blog.2nfree.com/categories/%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F/">云原生</category><description>&lt;h1 class="heading-element" id="资源"&gt;&lt;span&gt;资源&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e8%b5%84%e6%ba%90" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path